1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,510
Next week, Mumbai.

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:04,270
A hundred and fifty people in seven days.

3
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:07,150
A week later, all I have is a handle.

4
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:08,630
Who was degenwizard?

5
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:11,020
So I built Glance.

6
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:13,130
Glance today. Know them tomorrow.

7
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:14,870
Scan any code.

8
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,860
X, LinkedIn, Telegram,

9
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,460
WhatsApp. No code?

10
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:19,570
Just snap the badge.

11
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:21,390
Then just talk.

12
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:22,900
It works out who they are,

13
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:23,940
what we spoke about,

14
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:25,110
and what I owe them.

15
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,800
It finds them everywhere else too.

16
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:30,510
But nothing links until I say yes.

17
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:34,470
Every promise becomes a follow up.

18
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:35,570
already drafted.

19
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:38,790
And it all stays on my phone.

20
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,550
No server. Just me.

21
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:43,620
I built it for India Blockchain Week.

22
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:44,910
Now you tell me.

23
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,610
What should it remember next?
